{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Produced by\u00a0Jerboa\u00a0Interactive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A downloadable game for Windows. </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong> Solitude was developed by four students over the course of 1.5 years as part of a school project at Humboldt-Gymnasium Potsdam.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> The trailer and screenshots currently show the German version of the game. The full release will be in English. A German language option may be added, but is not yet confirmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/Pr\u00e4sentatiasdasadasdadson1.png?t=1746998039\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After crash-landing on a hostile alien world, you must explore, survive, and gather the parts needed to repair your damaged spaceship. Face dangerous environments, hostile machines, and mysterious structures as you fight to escape the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guided (and occasionally insulted) by your ship\u2019s sarcastic AI \u2014 \u201cTry not to die <i>again</i> this time, would you?\u201d \u2014 you\u2019ll traverse the desert in search of whatever scrap, tech, or ancient alien junk might help get your ship flight-ready. Expect challenges, surprises, and the kind of tough love only a malfunctioning assistant can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/TestimonialsBannerScaled.png?t=1746998039\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The best game to ever come out of Seminarkurs Gamedevelopment&quot; <br><strong>- Lutz Blum, Headmaster Humboldt\u00a0Gymnasium\u00a0Potsdam</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Hands down the best game featuring a spaceship crash on an alien planet I have ever played&quot; <strong> </strong><br><strong>- Marco Zanin, CS Year 12 Humboldt\u00a0Gymnasium\u00a0Potsdam</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/ControlsBannerScaled.png?t=1746998039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/ControlsEnglishScaledNew.png?t=1746998039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/extras/HumboldtlogoResized.png?t=1746998039\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719970?t=1746998039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/77ac2494d5c978e05d35d33cbbe83f1f80943dcb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746998039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/c5088a4ebbd3e222aa076d02ececb65bb66e46d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746998039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719970/c5088a4ebbd3e222aa076d02ececb65bb66e46d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746998039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Produced by\u00a0Jerboa\u00a0Interactive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A downloadable game for Windows. </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragr